    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Voice of the Mandate.</strong> Your voice now carries not just your own authority, but the weight of your faction’s mandate.</p><ul><li>Allies within 6 squares of you who can hear you gain a +1 bonus to defense check against being <strong>Shaken</strong> or <strong>charmed</strong>, and to <strong>last stand check</strong>.</li><li>On the strategic layer, once per turn when you personally participate in a Courtly Intrigue, Raid, or other opposed faction operation, you can grant your side a +1 bonus to one opposed roll representing speeches, appeals, or visible leadership.</li></ul>",
